WEBVTT

00:06:29.516 --> 00:06:32.676
or come with any trophies for doing so.

00:06:32.716 --> 00:06:35.436
You don't have to be a memory martyr.

00:06:35.476 --> 00:06:37.956
Having a word stuck
on the tip of your tongue

00:06:37.996 --> 00:06:41.036
is a totally normal glitch
in memory retrieval,

00:06:41.076 --> 00:06:44.196
a byproduct of how
our brains are organized.

00:06:44.236 --> 00:06:46.956
You wear glasses if your eyes
need help seeing,

00:06:46.956 --> 00:06:48.956
you have my permission to use Google

00:06:48.996 --> 00:06:51.636
if a word is stuck
on the tip of your tongue.

00:06:52.236 --> 00:06:54.356
Memory is amazing

00:06:54.356 --> 00:06:58.636
and is essential for the functioning
of almost everything we do,

00:06:58.676 --> 00:07:02.116
but it will also forget
to call your mother,